The waveforms, station positions and earthquake catalogue entries in this dataset are derived from
public data of the Southern California Seismic Network (SCSN), archived at the Southern California
Earthquake Data Center (SCEDC), and of the Northern California Seismic Network (NCSN), archived at
the Northern California Earthquake Data Center (NCEDC), as distributed through the AWS Open Data
program (s3://scedc-pds and s3://ncedc-pds).

SCEDC grants the non-exclusive, royalty free, non-transferable, worldwide right and license to use,
reproduce and publicly display in all media public data from the Southern California Seismic Network.
NCEDC grants the non-exclusive, royalty free, non-transferable, worldwide right and license to use,
reproduce and publicly display in all media public data from the Northern California Seismic Network.

Required citations:
- SCEDC (2013): Southern California Earthquake Data Center. Caltech. Dataset. doi:10.7909/C3WD3xH1
- California Institute of Technology and United States Geological Survey Pasadena (1926). Southern
  California Seismic Network. International Federation of Digital Seismograph Networks. doi:10.7914/SN/CI
- NCEDC (2014), Northern California Earthquake Data Center. UC Berkeley Seismological Laboratory.
  Dataset. doi:10.7932/NCEDC

The processing code and the arrangement of the data in this compilation are released under CC BY 4.0.
